/T (The new version is a function total_mess_bill\(filename\). It uses with, reads line by line, catches only InvalidOperation and ValueError, uses Decimal for the amounts and returns a list of rejected lines with the line number and the reason. Blank lines are skipped on purpose and are not treated as errors. A missing file is handled in the main part with FileNotFoundError. )
/E (The new version is a function total_mess_bill\(filename\). It uses with, reads line by line, catches only InvalidOperation and ValueError, uses Decimal for the amounts and returns a list of rejected lines with the line number and the reason. Blank lines are skipped on purpose and are not treated as errors. A missing file is handled in the main part with FileNotFoundError. )
/Pg 12 0 R
/K [5]
>>
