/E (In this version of the processor the file is opened in try. The except clauses are specific \(FileNotFoundError, PermissionError, UnicodeDecodeError, InvalidRecord\). The else part runs only when open\(\) worked. finally closes the file even when the function returns early because of the encoding error. parse_line\(\) uses raise ... from err, so for a line with the wrong number of fields the log shows that the cause was ValueError. )
/Pg 28 0 R
/K [5]
