/T (With the broad version the program printed \(0, 1\) and no message at all. The rightanswer was 2 present and 1 absent, so the result is wrong and nobody knows. The reason is thatthe typing error raises UnboundLocalError, which is a kind of NameError and so also a kindof Exception. The except Exception clause caught it and pass threw it away. With except InvalidRecord the same mistake is not caught, so Python showed the traceback andpointed to line 14, which is exactly what I want while developing. )
/E (With the broad version the program printed \(0, 1\) and no message at all. The rightanswer was 2 present and 1 absent, so the result is wrong and nobody knows. The reason is thatthe typing error raises UnboundLocalError, which is a kind of NameError and so also a kindof Exception. The except Exception clause caught it and pass threw it away. With except InvalidRecord the same mistake is not caught, so Python showed the traceback andpointed to line 14, which is exactly what I want while developing. )
/Pg 30 0 R
/K [6]
>>
