/Title (The new version is a function total_mess_bill\(filename\). It uses with, reads line by line, catches only InvalidOperation and ValueError, uses Decimal for the amounts and returns a list of rejected lines with the line number and the reason. Blank lines are skipped on purpose and are not treated as errors. A missing file is handled in the main part with FileNotFoundError.)
/Dest [12 0 R /Fit]
/Parent 2518 0 R
>>
