/Title (My version is safer for a 50,000 line file because it reads one line at a time, so the whole file is never held in memory. The with statement closes the file even if an error happens. Only ValueError and InvalidOperation are caught, so real bugs are not hidden. Every bad line is saved with its line number and reason, so the office can correct it. Amounts are Decimal, so paise are added exactly. The file name is a parameter, so any month can be processed.)
/Dest [14 0 R /Fit]
/Parent 2677 0 R
/First 2688 0 R
/Last 2688 0 R
/Count -1
>>
